[{"id":"cnm_264_q1","topicId":"cnm_264","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"直角边 3、4 的直角三角形内切圆半径？","answer":"1","explanation":"斜边为 5，直角三角形内切圆半径 r=(a+b-c)/2=(3+4-5)/2=1。","verify":"(3+4-sqrt(3**2+4**2))/2"},{"id":"cnm_264_q2","topicId":"cnm_264","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"三角形内切圆的圆心（内心）是","answer":"B","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"三边垂直平分线的交点"},{"key":"B","text":"三条角平分线的交点"},{"key":"C","text":"三条高的交点"}],"explanation":"内切圆圆心到三边距离相等，所以在三个内角的平分线上，是三条角平分线的交点。"},{"id":"cnm_264_q3","topicId":"cnm_264","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"直角边分别为 5、12 的直角三角形，求它的内切圆半径。","answer":"2","explanation":"斜边=13，r=(5+12-13)/2=2。","verify":"(5+12-sqrt(5**2+12**2))/2"},{"id":"cnm_264_q4","topicId":"cnm_264","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"△ABC 的内心为 I，∠A=50°，∠B=60°，求 ∠AIB 的度数（单位：度）。","answer":"125","explanation":"AI、BI 分别平分 ∠A、∠B，∠IAB+∠IBA=25°+30°=55°，所以 ∠AIB=180°-55°=125°。","verify":"180-50/2-60/2"},{"id":"cnm_264_q5","topicId":"cnm_264","difficulty":"advanced","type":"numeric","prompt":"△ABC 中 AB=7，BC=8，CA=9，内切圆与 BC 相切于点 E，求 BE 的长。","answer":"3","explanation":"设切点分别在 AB、BC、CA 上，由切线长相等得 BE=(AB+BC-CA)/2=(7+8-9)/2=3。","verify":"(7+8-9)/2"},{"id":"cnm_265_q1","topicId":"cnm_265","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"直角三角形外接圆圆心在哪里？","answer":"C","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"直角顶点"},{"key":"B","text":"斜边上的高的垂足"},{"key":"C","text":"斜边中点"}],"explanation":"直角所对的弦是直径，所以斜边是外接圆的直径，圆心在斜边中点。"},{"id":"cnm_265_q2","topicId":"cnm_265","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"直角三角形的斜边长为 10，求它的外接圆半径。","answer":"5","explanation":"斜边是外接圆直径，半径=10÷2=5。","verify":"10/2"},{"id":"cnm_265_q3","topicId":"cnm_265","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"直角边分别为 6、8 的直角三角形，求它的外接圆半径。","answer":"5","explanation":"斜边=√(6^2+8^2)=10，外接圆半径等于斜边的一半，为 5。","verify":"sqrt(6**2+8**2)/2"},{"id":"cnm_265_q4","topicId":"cnm_265","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"钝角三角形的外心在","answer":"C","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"三角形的内部"},{"key":"B","text":"最长边的中点"},{"key":"C","text":"三角形的外部"}],"explanation":"锐角三角形外心在内部，直角三角形外心在斜边中点，钝角三角形外心在外部。"},{"id":"cnm_265_q5","topicId":"cnm_265","difficulty":"advanced","type":"numeric","prompt":"△ABC 中，∠A=40°，O 是它的外心，求 ∠OBC 的度数（单位：度）。","answer":"50","explanation":"∠BOC=2∠A=80°，又 OB=OC，所以 ∠OBC=(180°-80°)/2=50°。","verify":"90-40"}]
